   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "小贴士1：考虑烹制素菜",
   "texts": [
    "/rooms/kitchen/how-to/yi4-da4-li4-feng1-wei4-su4-shi2-rou4-jiang4-mian4-pub65b6f490",
    "NO",
    "ikea://cms/page-compatible-web?url=%2Frooms%2Fkitchen%2Fhow-to%2Fyi4-da4-li4-feng1-wei4-su4-shi2-rou4-jiang4-mian4-pub65b6f490&key=cn--zh--65b6f490445511eb9a3b53965577f08f",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"/rooms/kitchen/how-to/yi4-da4-li4-feng1-wei4-su4-shi2-rou4-jiang4-mian4-pub65b6f490\",\"objectType_var\":\"cms/page-compatible-web\"}",
    "如果大家都已饥肠辘辘，不妨采用VÄRLDSKLOK 瓦勒克罗 可定型素碎肉作为主食材，轻松快速地烹制各种美食，例如令人垂涎的素食汉堡、素肉丸子、意大利肉酱面或炸玉米饼。VÄRLDSKLOK 瓦勒克罗 尝起来就像真肉一样，但由植物蛋白制成，这样意味着你将做出更可持续的选择，而且还经济实惠！",
    "小贴士1：考虑烹制素菜"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/cc9074cd3906a1b/original/PH180499-crop001.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
